    "detailed_description": "<i>Prepare for an intergalactic adventure in Flappy Alien!</i><br><br>Navigate your way through the vast expanse of space, piloting a nimble UFO on a thrilling journey. Dodge obstacles, test your reflexes, and aim for the highest score in this addictive arcade game.<br><br>Flappy Alien offers a perfect blend of challenge and simplicity, making it an ideal game for quick sessions or extended play. Take off into space and see how far you can go!<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Simple Controls: Press the space button or click to thrust your UFO upward and navigate through treacherous obstacles.<br></li><li>Endless Challenges: The randomly generated obstacles keep every playthrough unique and engaging.<br></li><li>High Score System: Compete against yourself and others to achieve the highest score possible.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3102020/extras/ad49883f1aa2e7a7b034c32cc2f02bce.avif?t=1736735111\" width=600 height=336 /></span></li></ul>",
